Task: Implement a robust tooltip system to display detailed item information on hover.
Changes:
- Added m_hoveredItem to UISystem to track the currently hovered item.
- Implemented DrawTooltip in UISystem with support for item name, rarity, type, slot, stats, and affixes.
- Extended GetAffixDescription in ItemStats.hpp to support all AffixType values.
- Added ItemStatsTest.cpp to verify affix description formatting.
- Integrated tooltip rendering into the UISystem::Draw loop.
Why: To provide players with detailed information about items in their inventory and equipment slots.
